                <pb facs="0390" n="302" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg302"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr. Porter.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-02-15"><hi rendition="#italic">February 15,
                        1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Hay directs Mr. Porter to express the gratification of the President for the
                    prompt and hearty cooperation of France in the matter of China’s
                    neutrality.)</p>
            </div>
